  (gr_text "#1: Info: below are the conversion remarks. The conversion may contain errors.\nPlease read the remarks carefully and run the DRC check to solve issues.\nTo find a component mentioned in the remarks go to:\nKicad menu Edit > Find and enter the EDA_id (gge....); search for other text items.\nOnly the id of the footprint can be found; the id of the shape is in the input json.\nYou can export the footprints to a library by Kicad menu File > Export > Export Fps to (new) Library" (at -200 16.2) (layer "Cmts.User") (tstamp 9e427954-2486-4c91-89b5-6af73a073442)
